		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A 5-foot-wide, toothy mouth that floats in mid-air, surrounded by pulsating, fleshy tendrils.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 34, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +6 (2d6 + acid), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Acid</strong>. Non-magical organic material bitten by qlippoth dissolves on a d6 roll of 1-3.</p><p></p><p><strong>Great Evil</strong>. Only damaged by cold iron or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Horrific Appearance</strong>. Mortal creatures looking directly at qlippoth, CON 15+ or 1d4 CHA damage. On success, immune for 24 hours.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
